msgstr "URL de callback à configurer dans HelloAsso"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:131
msgid "Enable test mode"
msgstr "Activer le mode test"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:137
msgid "Your organizationSlug"
msgstr "Votre organizationSlug"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:143
msgid "Your clientId"
msgstr "Votre clientId"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:149
msgid "Your clientSecret"
msgstr "Votre clientSecret"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:155
msgid "Accept SEPA transfers"
msgstr "Accepter les virements SEPA"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:177
msgid "Amounts can be defined in the contributions types settings."
msgstr ""
"Les montants peuvent être définis dans les paramètres des types de "
"contributions."

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:218
msgid ""
"Zero amounts, even if they are not disabled, are not proposed as a payment "
"reason on the form. You can disable this reason, or set a positive value in "
"the contributions types settings."
msgstr ""
"Les montants nuls, même s'ils ne sont pas désactivés, ne sont pas proposés "
"comme motif de paiement sur le formulaire. Vous pouvez désactiver ce motif "
"ou définir une valeur positive dans les paramètres des types de "
"contributions."

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:263
msgid "Connected to HelloAsso"
msgstr "Connecté à HelloAsso"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:269
msgid "Not connected to HelloAsso"
msgstr "Non connecté à HelloAsso"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:282
msgid "Test mode enabled"
msgstr "Mode test activé"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:299
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nom"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:315
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:330
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Type"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:342
msgid "Category"
msgstr "Catégorie"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:358
msgid "RNA Number"
msgstr "Numéro RNA"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:377
msgid ""
"HelloAsso helps organizations collect payments online and offers its "
"services free of charge. It covers all transaction fees so you can receive "
"all the money your audiences contribute, free of charge. The voluntary "
"contributions they leave are their sole source of income."
msgstr ""
"HelloAsso aide les associations à collecter des paiements en ligne et "
"propose ses services gratuitement. Elle prend à sa charge tous les frais de "
"transaction pour que vous puissiez bénéficier de la totalité des sommes "
"versées par vos publics, sans frais. Les contributions volontaires laissées "
"par ces derniers sont leur unique source de revenus."

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_form.html.twig:79
msgid "Select a payment reason"
msgstr "Sélectionnez un motif de paiement"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_form.html.twig:191
msgid "Pay with HelloAsso"
msgstr "Payer avec HelloAsso"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_form.html.twig:199
msgid "Secured payment"
msgstr "Paiement sécurisé"

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_form.html.twig:223
#, no-php-format
msgid ""
"We have chosen HelloAsso to process your payment. HelloAsso guarantees that "
"100% of your payment will be donated to our organization. You can support "
"the assistance they provide to organizations by leaving a voluntary "
"contribution to HelloAsso at the time of your payment."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons choisi HelloAsso pour réaliser votre paiement. HelloAsso garantit "
"que 100% de votre paiement sera versé à notre association. Vous pouvez "
"soutenir l’aide qu’ils apportent aux associations en laissant une "
"contribution volontaire à HelloAsso au moment de votre paiement."

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_form.html.twig:234
msgid "No payment reasons are available."
msgstr "Aucun motif de paiement n'est disponible."

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_form.html.twig:276
msgid "You have to select an option."
msgstr "Vous devez sélectionner une option."

#: ../tempcache/helloasso_form.html.twig:285
msgid "Please enter an amount."
msgstr "Veuillez entrer un montant."

